{"id":"f98755188bbee776","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-martingale.md","title":"Schnorr 随机性的有效速度鞅刻画","display":"thm-schnorr-martingale — Schnorr 随机性的有效速度鞅刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-martingale","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-martingale"],"display":"thm-schnorr-martingale — Schnorr 随机性的有效速度鞅刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","[[43-df-schnorr-success]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.4.1 Theorem 10.4.4，印刷220–221，PDF240–241","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-martingale — Schnorr 随机性的有效速度鞅刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59be57c107bd283a\" href=\"?note=59be57c107bd283a\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-success\">43-df-schnorr-success</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.4.1 Theorem 10.4.4，印刷220–221，PDF240–241"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59be57c107bd283a\" href=\"?note=59be57c107bd283a\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-success\">43-df-schnorr-success</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\">\\((2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59be57c107bd283a\" href=\"?note=59be57c107bd283a\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-success\">43-df-schnorr-success</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}(d,X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}(d,X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿给“在每个可计算截止时刻之前达到所有整数资本”条件，过强且未声明g总性。已恢复源书“沿可计算阶函数无穷多次达到”的正确条件。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4.1 Theorem 10.4.4，印刷220–221，PDF240–241。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-success","status":"resolved","id":"59be57c107bd283a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-success]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；谓词见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorr-success]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-success","status":"resolved","id":"59be57c107bd283a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；谓词见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorr-success]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}$ 是 $(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega$ 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，见 [[43-df-schnorr-success]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-success","status":"resolved","id":"59be57c107bd283a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}$ 是 $(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega$ 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，见 [[43-df-schnorr-success]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}","display":false},{"tex":"(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall d\\;\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}(d,X).","display":true}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-schnorr-martingale]] — Schnorr 随机性的有效速度鞅刻画"}],"outgoing":["c8d43a74ea8721f3","59be57c107bd283a"]}